  13:../../libDaisy/src/hid/digital_control.h ****  * updated value. This is because the input to this may often be a callable
  14:../../libDaisy/src/hid/digital_control.h ****  * (e.g. shiftreg.State(x), gpio.Read()) that may not be stateful.
