2011:../../libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm7.h **** /**
2012:../../libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \brief   Get Active Interrupt
2013:../../libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \details Reads the active register in the NVIC and returns the active bit for the device specific
2014:../../libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \param [in]      IRQn  Device specific interrupt number.
2015:../../libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \return             0  Interrupt status is not active.
2016:../../libDaisy/Drivers/CMSIS_5/CMSIS/Core/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \return             1  Interrupt status is active.
